---
import InnerLayout from "../../layouts/InnerLayout.astro";
import LinkBox from "../../components/SolutionLinkBox.astro";
---

<InnerLayout>
  <section class="it-services-all">
    <div class="container">
      <LinkBox />
      <div class="text-container">
        <h3>STORAGE SOLUTIONS</h3>
        <p>
          BIM sets the standard in highly available, scalable, and reliable
          platforms that protect, manage and retrieve business-critical
          information for virtually every enterprise computing environment. An
          Equalogic, HP, Nexsan, and Imation Authorized Partner, BIM surrounds
          our partners technology services with our rich knowledge base,
          comprehensive skills set, professionalism, and consistency of
          execution. BIM can design, deploy and maintain the right storage
          solution for your organization, working with experts in enterprise
          storage, enterprise management, business continuity solutions, and
          information lifecycle management.
        </p>
        <p>
          BIM storage solutions help organizations centralize and automate
          storage management tasks, reduce costs by consolidating resources, and
          protect information to ensure business continuity. Our customers
          include the world’s largest companies, manufacturers, healthcare
          institutions, life sciences organizations, telecommunications
          providers, airlines, transportation companies, educational
          institutions, regional and national government agencies, among others.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="/contact">CONTACT US</a>TODAY TO DISCUSS STORAGE SOLUTIONS?
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="img-container">
        <img src="/images/icons/technology.jpg" alt="" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</InnerLayout>
